    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Prototype is a \u2018game\u2019 created by an unnamed developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are asked to try this game...or \u2018prototype\u2019 and find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is hiding in this prototype or someone,\u00a0 we don't know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just avoid getting caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game lasts about 10 to 20 minutes and contains flashing lights and sometimes loud noises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Lost Prototype is a test \u2018game\u2019 to train myself on Unreal Engine and especially to make my steamwork account and stuff).</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Prototype is a \u2018game\u2019 created by an unnamed developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are asked to try this game...or \u2018prototype\u2019 and find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is hiding in this prototype or someone,\u00a0 we don't know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just avoid getting caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game lasts about 10 to 20 minutes and contains flashing lights and sometimes loud noises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Lost Prototype is a test \u2018game\u2019 to train myself on Unreal Engine and especially to make my steamwork account and stuff).</p>",
